  Radiation β=1/2 ⇒ γ = sqrt(k_mom(k_mom+c_chop)), v = sqrt(k/(c+k))

(2) Curvature–friction force balance (why it is not enough alone):
  κ = 2π/m, ξ_h = 1/(m c_s),  κ = 2π c_s ξ_h  (identity).
