  Balance + Hubble: ξ H ~ sqrt( (κ H ln)/(4π α_B) ).
  Problem: right-hand side still carries H (and m) → not a pure
  constant γ* unless α_B or ln runs to cancel H. Scaling γ* = const
  requires the dimensionless VOS reduction, not bare force balance.
  ⇒ mutual friction must enter as dimensionless (c_chop, k_mom).

